# 14_hypnagogic_RGB.ledc — Hypnagogic Twilight, RGB inner/outer build (base: 14_hypnagogic_twilight; name shortened for SPIFFS 32-char limit)
# RGB variant of 14_hypnagogic_twilight. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (isochronic + floating
# 8<->12 Hz imagery drift). LEDs on inner ring (mask 9) + outer ring (mask 6), 180
# antiphase, SINE gate — the inner<->outer alternation reads as a radial imagery pulse.
# Cool white (200,220,255) drives the imagery bands; a violet-blue (90,40,200) mood for
# the theta descent. Flicker <=12 Hz throughout; brightness <=30%. See base header.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]

# --- Settle / induction (10 Hz alpha): vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 200 220 255 9 1 0     # inner cool-white: 10 Hz sine, fade-in
0 10 50 >0 200 220 255 6 1 180   # outer: antiphase radial
A 0 200 0 >0 10 1                 # isochronic 200 Hz pulsed at 10 Hz; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 47 "Let your eyes rest closed and soften your gaze."
15000 10 50 25 200 220 255 9 1 0  # inner: 25% reached
15000 10 50 25 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
30000 10 50 ~20:30:10000 200 220 255 9 1 0   # inner: breathing 20<->30%
30000 10 50 ~20:30:10000 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
A 60000 200 0 100 10 1             # vol settled, beat 10 Hz

# --- Descent to theta twilight (10->6.5) ---
300000 >10 50 ~20:30:10000 90 40 200 9 1 0   # inner: freq 10->6.5; violet-blue mood
300000 >10 50 ~20:30:10000 90 40 200 6 1 180 # outer
A 300000 200 0 100 >10 1           # isochronic beat 10->6.5 lockstep
S 305000 default 47 "Drifting down now, toward the twilight edge between waking and sleep."
660000 6.5 50 ~20:30:10000 90 40 200 9 1 0   # inner: twilight bottom 6.5 Hz
660000 6.5 50 ~20:30:10000 90 40 200 6 1 180 # outer

# --- Imagery hold: float 8<->12 Hz (75 s/cycle), cool white ---
720000 ~8:12:75000 50 ~20:30:10000 200 220 255 9 1 0   # inner: freq floats 8<->12 Hz
720000 ~8:12:75000 50 ~20:30:10000 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer: antiphase (radial imagery)
A 720000 200 0 100 ~8:12:75000 1   # isochronic beat floats 8<->12 Hz, locked 1:1
S 725000 default 47 "Let images and colors arise — watch them, without holding on."
S 1080000 default 47 "Rest at the border. Notice the shapes drift and change."

# --- Soft fade: settle to 10 Hz, brightness + vol fade to 0 over 4 min ---
1440000 10 50 >30 200 220 255 9 1 0   # inner: steady 10 Hz; bright 30->0
1440000 10 50 >30 200 220 255 6 1 180 # outer
A 1440000 200 0 >100 10 1          # beat settles to 10 Hz; vol 50->0
S 1440000 default 47 "Gently returning now."
1680000 10 50 0 200 220 255 9 1 0     # inner off
1680000 10 50 0 200 220 255 6 1 180   # outer off
A 1680000 200 0 0 10 1             # volume 0
